<title>USA: ATEC Group to buyback up to two mln shrs.</title>
<headline>ATEC Group to buyback up to two mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>EAST NORTHPORT, N.Y. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ATEC Group Inc said Friday that it will repurchase up to two million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The computer dealer and reseller of enterprise computer networking products said the buybacks will be from time to time on the open market or in negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>The company said it has about 17 million common shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
